        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>中考英语万能作文模板</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimHei\", sans-serif;\n            background-color: #f5f5f5;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 20px;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n        }\n        .document {\n            background-color: #fff;\n            width: 100%;\n            max-width: 800px;\n            padding: 40px 50px;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n            position: relative;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        .title-box {\n            border: 3px solid #7a9ebf;\n            background-color: #e6f0fa;\n            padding: 15px;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 36px;\n            font-weight: normal;\n            color: #444;\n            margin-bottom: 40px;\n            letter-spacing: 2px;\n        }\n        .bracket-group {\n            position: relative;\n            padding-left: 30px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        .curly-brace {\n            position: absolute;\n            left: 0;\n            top: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            width: 20px;\n        }\n        .section {\n            position: relative;\n            margin-bottom: 25px;\n        }\n        .heading {\n            font-size: 18px;\n            color: #555;\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n        }\n        .heading .blue-text {\n            color: #3b73a9;\n        }\n        .description {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            color: #444;\n            margin-left: 28px;\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n        }\n        .list {\n            list-style: none;\n            padding: 0;\n            margin: 0 0 0 28px;\n            font-size: 15px;\n            color: #444;\n        }\n        .list li {\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .template-box {\n            background-color: #e6e8eb;\n            padding: 25px 30px;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n            font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            line-height: 2;\n            color: #222;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n        .template-box p {\n            text-indent: 2em;\n            margin: 0 0 15px 0;\n        }\n        .template-box p:last-child {\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n        .watermark {\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: 15px;\n            right: 25px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            transform: rotate(-15deg);\n            color: #fff;\n            font-family: sans-serif;\n            text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n            opacity: 0.9;\n        }\n        .heart-icon {\n            font-size: 28px;\n            margin-right: 5px;\n        }\n        .watermark-text {\n            font-size: 12px;\n            line-height: 1.3;\n        }\n        .handwritten {\n            font-family: \"Kaiti\", \"STKaiti\", cursive;\n            color: #d9534f;\n            position: absolute;\n            white-space: nowrap;\n            opacity: 0.85;\n        }\n        .note1 {\n            top: 30px;\n            right: 60px;\n            font-size: 28px;\n            transform: rotate(-4deg);\n        }\n        .note2 {\n            top: 10px;\n            right: 50px;\n            font-size: 30px;\n            transform: rotate(-3deg);\n            border-bottom: 6px solid rgba(160, 212, 104, 0.6);\n            line-height: 0.9;\n            padding-bottom: 2px;\n        }\n        .note3 {\n            top: 60px;\n            right: 10px;\n            font-size: 28px;\n            transform: rotate(-2deg);\n            border-bottom: 6px solid rgba(205, 168, 229, 0.6);\n            line-height: 0.9;\n            padding-bottom: 2px;\n        }\n        .note4 {\n            top: 110px;\n            right: 30px;\n            font-size: 28px;\n            transform: rotate(-2deg);\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"document\">\n        <div class=\"title-box\">中考英语万能作文模板</div>\n\n        <div class=\"bracket-group\">\n            <svg class=\"curly-brace\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 100\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n                <path d=\"M 20 0 C 5 0, 5 10, 5 20 L 5 40 C 5 50, 0 50, 0 50 C 0 50, 5 50, 5 60 L 5 80 C 5 90, 5 100, 20 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#a0b0c0\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n            </svg>\n            \n            <div class=\"section\">\n                <div class=\"heading\">※ 中考英语作文万能模板：<span class=\"blue-text\">阐述主题题型</span></div>\n                <div class=\"description\">要求从一句话或一个主题出发，按照提纲的要求进行论述.</div>\n                <ul class=\"list\">\n                    <li>1. 阐述名言或主题所蕴涵的意义.</li>\n                    <li>2. 分析并举例使其更充实.</li>\n                </ul>\n                <div class=\"handwritten note1\">行动起来！</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"section\">\n                <div class=\"heading\">※ 中考英语作文万能模板：<span class=\"blue-text\">解决方法题型</span></div>\n                <div class=\"description\">要求考生列举出解决问题的多种途径</div>\n                <ul class=\"list\">\n                    <li>1. 问题现状</li>\n                    <li>2. 怎样解决(解决方案的优缺点)</li>\n                </ul>\n                <div class=\"handwritten note2\">不要假努力！</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"template-box\">\n            <p>In recent days, we have to face I problem-----A, which is becoming more and more serious. First, ------------(说明A的现状). Second, -------------(举例进一步说明现状)</p>\n            <p>Confronted with A, we should take a series of effective measures to cope with the situation. For one thing, ---------------(解决方法一). For another -------------(解决方法二). Finally, --------------(解决方法三).</p>\n            <p>Personally, I believe that -------------(我的解决方法). Consequently, I'm confident that a bright future isawaiting us because --------------(带来的好处).</p>\n            <div class=\"watermark\">\n                <div class=\"heart-icon\">♥</div>\n                <div class=\"watermark-text\">\n                    @新暮图书<br>From 小红书\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"section\">\n            <div class=\"heading\">※ 中考英语作文万能模板：<span class=\"blue-text\">说明利弊题型</span></div>\n            <div class=\"description\">这种题型往往要求先说明一下现状，再对比事物本身的利弊，有时也会单从一角度（利或弊）出发，最后往往要求考生表明自己的态度（或对事物前景提出预)</div>\n            <ul class=\"list\">\n                <li>1. 说明事物现状</li>\n            </ul>\n            <div class=\"handwritten note3\">你可以拒绝学习的动力</div>\n            <div class=\"handwritten note4\">但你的竞争者不会！</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
